<title>HONG KONG: Chun Wo to spinoff foundation business.</title>
<headline>Chun Wo to spinoff foundation business.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction group Chun Wo Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it intended to spinoff its foundation business but that no application to list the unit had yet been made.</p>
<p>The company said its intention to spin-off its foundation business was &quot;at an early stage and no application has been made to the Stock Exchange&quot;.</p>
<p>&quot;The proposed spin-off may or may not proceed,&quot; it added.</p>
<p>Chun Wo shares were down HK$0.01 at HK$1.27 in early trade.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
